---
interface Props { lang: "fr" | "en"; figure: 1 | 2 | 3; }
const { lang, figure } = Astro.props;
---

{lang === "fr" && figure === 1 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 400" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-fr-1-title traces06-fr-1-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-fr-1-title">Quatre effets économiques</title>
<desc id="traces06-fr-1-desc">Grille de lecture qualitative. Trésorerie : amende ou réparation. Recettes : usages restreints. Données : fichiers et produits dérivés à traiter. Contrôle : évaluations récurrentes. Aucun montant total calculé.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="400" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Quatre effets économiques</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Ordonnances et sanctions · 2024–2025</text>
<text x="20" y="108" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Trésorerie</text>
<text x="20" y="138" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Amende ou réparation</text>
<text x="20" y="188" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Recettes</text>
<text x="20" y="218" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Usages restreints</text>
<text x="20" y="268" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Données</text>
<text x="20" y="298" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Fichiers et dérivés à traiter</text>
<text x="20" y="348" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Contrôle</text>
<text x="20" y="378" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Évaluations récurrentes</text>
<line x1="20" y1="154" x2="460" y2="154" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="234" x2="460" y2="234" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="314" x2="460" y2="314" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Lecture économique des dispositifs Mobilewalla, Avast et Gravy–Venntel. Les obligations diffèrent selon les affaires ; aucune addition de coûts ni estimation de perte. <a href="#source-4">S04</a> <a href="#source-9">S09</a> <a href="#source-13">S13</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "fr" && figure === 2 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 396" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-fr-2-title traces06-fr-2-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-fr-2-title">De la fermeture aux paiements</title>
<desc id="traces06-fr-2-desc">Janvier 2020 : fermeture de Jumpshot annoncée par Avast. 26 juin 2024 : règlement final, versement de 16,5 millions de dollars exigé. 2 décembre 2025 : la FTC annonce l’envoi de près de 15,3 millions de dollars à 103 152 clients. Espacement non proportionnel aux durées.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="396" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">De la fermeture aux paiements</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Avast / Jumpshot · 2020–2025</text>
<text x="20" y="105" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Janvier 2020</text>
<text x="20" y="136" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Jumpshot fermé, selon Avast</text>
<text x="20" y="183" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">26 juin 2024</text>
<text x="20" y="214" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">16,5 M$ exigés par l’accord</text>
<text x="20" y="263" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">2 décembre 2025</text>
<text x="20" y="294" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Près de 15,3 M$ envoyés</text>
<text x="20" y="325" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">103 152 clients bénéficiaires</text>
<line x1="20" y1="153" x2="460" y2="153" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="231" x2="460" y2="231" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Chronologie à espacement non proportionnel. Dollars américains nominaux : somme due selon l’accord et paiements annoncés comme envoyés aux demandeurs ayant une réclamation valable. <a href="#source-9">S09</a> <a href="#source-10">S10</a> <a href="#source-11">S11</a> <a href="#source-12">S12</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "fr" && figure === 3 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 398" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-fr-3-title traces06-fr-3-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-fr-3-title">DROP : deux populations</title>
<desc id="traces06-fr-3-desc">99,9 % des consommateurs ont une suppression de profil rapportée chez au moins un courtier. Environ 25 % des 654 courtiers ont déclaré traiter des demandes. Plus de 500 000 consommateurs inscrits. Les deux taux utilisent des populations différentes.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="398" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">DROP : deux populations</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Bilan CalPrivacy · 25 août 2026</text>
<text x="20" y="113" font-size="27" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">99,9 %</text>
<text x="20" y="146" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">des consommateurs</text>
<text x="20" y="178" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">au moins un courtier a supprimé</text>
<text x="20" y="209" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">leur profil, selon le bilan</text>
<text x="20" y="274" font-size="27" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">≈ 25 %</text>
<text x="20" y="307" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">des 654 courtiers</text>
<text x="20" y="339" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">ont déclaré traiter des demandes</text>
<line x1="20" y1="234" x2="460" y2="234" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Deux dénominateurs distincts : consommateurs du système et courtiers inscrits. Plus de 500 000 consommateurs à cette date. Résultats rapportés par les courtiers ; aucun taux global d’effacement des données n’est calculé. <a href="#source-19">S19</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 1 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 400" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-en-1-title traces06-en-1-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-en-1-title">Four economic effects</title>
<desc id="traces06-en-1-desc">Qualitative framework. Cash: fine or redress. Earnings: restricted uses. Data: datasets and derived products to address. Oversight: recurring assessments. No total cost calculated.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="400" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Four economic effects</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Orders and penalties · 2024–2025</text>
<text x="20" y="108" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Cash</text>
<text x="20" y="138" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Fine or consumer redress</text>
<text x="20" y="188" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Earnings</text>
<text x="20" y="218" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Restricted uses</text>
<text x="20" y="268" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Data</text>
<text x="20" y="298" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Datasets and derived products</text>
<text x="20" y="348" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">Oversight</text>
<text x="20" y="378" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Recurring assessments</text>
<line x1="20" y1="154" x2="460" y2="154" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="234" x2="460" y2="234" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="314" x2="460" y2="314" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Economic reading of the Mobilewalla, Avast and Gravy–Venntel remedies. Requirements differ by case; costs are neither added together nor estimated. <a href="#source-4">S04</a> <a href="#source-9">S09</a> <a href="#source-13">S13</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 2 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 396" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-en-2-title traces06-en-2-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-en-2-title">From closure to payments</title>
<desc id="traces06-en-2-desc">January 2020: Jumpshot closure reported by Avast. 26 June 2024: final settlement requires a 16.5 million dollar payment. 2 December 2025: the FTC announces nearly 15.3 million dollars being sent to 103,152 customers. Event spacing is not proportional to elapsed time.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="396" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">From closure to payments</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Avast / Jumpshot · 2020–2025</text>
<text x="20" y="105" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">January 2020</text>
<text x="20" y="136" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Jumpshot closed, Avast says</text>
<text x="20" y="183" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">26 June 2024</text>
<text x="20" y="214" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">$16.5m required by settlement</text>
<text x="20" y="263" font-size="22" fill="#72e5df" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">2 December 2025</text>
<text x="20" y="294" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">Nearly $15.3m sent</text>
<text x="20" y="325" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">103,152 customer recipients</text>
<line x1="20" y1="153" x2="460" y2="153" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
<line x1="20" y1="231" x2="460" y2="231" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Events spaced for readability. Nominal US dollars: money due under the settlement and payments announced as sent to customers with valid claims. <a href="#source-9">S09</a> <a href="#source-10">S10</a> <a href="#source-11">S11</a> <a href="#source-12">S12</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

{lang === "en" && figure === 3 && (
<figure class="commerce-rules-figure">
<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 480 398" style="width:100%;height:auto" role="img" aria-labelledby="traces06-en-3-title traces06-en-3-desc" font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif">
<title id="traces06-en-3-title">DROP: two populations</title>
<desc id="traces06-en-3-desc">99.9% of consumers have a profile deletion reported by at least one broker. Approximately 25% of the 654 brokers reported processing requests. More than 500,000 consumers registered. The rates have different denominators.</desc>
<rect x="0" y="0" width="480" height="398" fill="#0c0e10"/>
<text x="20" y="32" font-size="23" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">DROP: two populations</text>
<text x="20" y="62" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">CalPrivacy update · 25 August 2026</text>
<text x="20" y="113" font-size="27" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">99.9%</text>
<text x="20" y="146" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">of consumers</text>
<text x="20" y="178" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">at least one broker deleted</text>
<text x="20" y="209" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">their profile, the agency reports</text>
<text x="20" y="274" font-size="27" fill="#f2c875" font-weight="500" text-anchor="start">≈ 25%</text>
<text x="20" y="307" font-size="21" fill="#f0f4fa" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">of the 654 brokers</text>
<text x="20" y="339" font-size="21" fill="#b8c8db" font-weight="400" text-anchor="start">reported processing requests</text>
<line x1="20" y1="234" x2="460" y2="234" stroke="#344352" stroke-width="1.5"/>
</svg>
<figcaption>Two denominators: consumers in the system and registered brokers. More than 500,000 consumers at that date. Outcomes reported by brokers; no overall data-erasure rate is calculated. <a href="#source-19">S19</a></figcaption>
</figure>
)}

<style>
  .commerce-rules-figure { width: 100%; max-width: 42rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .commerce-rules-figure > svg { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 27rem; height: auto; margin-inline: auto; }
  .commerce-rules-figure > figcaption { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-muted); }
</style>
